\begin{frame}{Introduction}
\vspace{-1.5cm}
\begin{itemize}
\item Real-time chat applications allow instant communication between users.
\item Messages are delivered without refreshing the page.
\item Messaging apps like WhatsApp and Messenger are widely used today.
\item These apps support text messaging, image sharing, and online status.
\item This project uses the MERN stack and Socket.io for real-time communication.
\end{itemize}

\end{frame}
